5,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm so excited to play! Since it's the first day, does anyone have any ideas on how we should find the werewolf?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It's a bit early for a concrete plan, but observing how everyone reacts to the pressure of the first few turns usually reveals the most.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Victoria. For now, let's focus on listening to each other's logic and seeing if anyone's behavior seems inconsistent or overly forced.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"I'll be watching closely. Since we have no information yet, I'm curious to see who tries too hard to lead the conversation or who stays too quiet.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that sounds a bit scary! But I'll try my best to be honest. Does anyone think they might be the Seer already?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,I think it's too risky for the Seer to reveal themselves this early. They would become an immediate target for the werewolf.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Victoria is correct. The Seer should remain hidden for now to ensure they can gather as much information as possible over the next few nights.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Revealing the Seer now would only shorten the game in the werewolf's favor. We should prioritize survival for the first night.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"It seems we're all in agreement on the Seer's safety. Since we're just waiting for the first night, I wonder if the werewolf is already feeling nervous about being found.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm not nervous at all! But @Toshio, you've been very quiet so far. Are you just being cautious, or are you hiding something?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, it's natural for some to be more reserved. Toshio's silence isn't necessarily a sign of guilt; it could simply be his way of observing us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's not jump to conclusions based on personality alone. While Rin's curiosity is helpful, we should avoid baseless accusations that could lead to a mistake.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"I'm simply observing, as Shion suggested. I prefer to listen and analyze the flow of the conversation before contributing my own thoughts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Fair enough. Though, being the ""observer"" is a convenient shield for both the innocent and the guilty. I'll be keeping an eye on that.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'll be watching too! I hope we can all get along, but I'm going to be super careful about who I trust. Good luck to everyone tonight!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"Good luck to you as well, Rin. Let's all try to stay alert and see what the first morning brings us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's maintain our composure and trust our logic. I look forward to seeing how the dynamics shift once we have actual results to discuss tomorrow.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll be doing the same. Let's hope for a productive first day tomorrow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll be waiting. Let's see who survives the night and what the Seer discovers. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
